            "review_title": "Review at Shabu Ya",
            "review_text": "Johnny-Vu\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam61 contributions\n0\nRelaxing\nJun 2019 • Friends\nToday i’ve come here with my family i feel great with attitude off service in here and food are so delicious \nCome here when you have free times with your family\nWritten June 21, 2019\nLeKienLki\nThank you for taking your time to share your experience you had with Shabu Ya, Johnny. We always want to make our guests happy and your amazing review make us happy too. We hope to see you in our restaurant again soon.\n\nBest regards!\nRead more\nWritten July 3, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
